        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are proud to present new to the market for sale No.16 Donomore Avenue. This fine 3 bedroom property comes to the market sure to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Tallaght, number 16 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, cafes, parks, sports facilities, primary and secondary schools. It is also only a stones throw away from The Square shopping centre which has everything you would need.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property you are immediately met with a bright and open entrance hallway which sets the tone for what the rest of the property has to offer. Just off this you have a warm and spacious front reception room completed with a classic feature fireplace. Moving through the property you have a modern and fully equipped kitchen and dining area with plenty of light coming in through the patio doors.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you will find a large and sunny South East facing back garden, an idyllic space to spend those long summer evenings entertaining or simply catching some rays.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises three bedrooms, a double alongside a single to the rear and a double bedroom to the front aspect. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor.\r\n\r\nThis area benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes running through the area. The Tallaght bypass also gives you easy access to motorways and other parts of the city.\r\n\r\nThis property will be popular so early viewing is recommended. \r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Large sunny back garden\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Turn key condition"
      },
